    <md:title>7.5.3: Self Check</md:title>
    <md:uuid>744ff59b-aa4a-46fe-a2a6-f45e7f36b73d</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section>
    <para dir="ltr">A small ball is dropped from a 350-foot-tall building. Which equation could represent the ball’s height, \(h(t)\), in feet, relative to the ground, as a function of time, \(t\), in seconds?</para>
  </section>
</content>
